				<section data-dce-background-color="#FFFFFF" data-dce-background-overlay-color="#FFFFFFCC" data-dce-background-image-url="https://prcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/hallway-minus-mopbucket_0000_Pearl-River-Community-College_PRCC_Huff-Hall-Hallway.jpg" data-dce-background-overlay-image-url="https://prcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/13931-PRCC-Design-Elements-V002_1-3.png" class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-57603bf elementor-section-content-top elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="57603bf" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" id="success" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;_ha_eqh_enable&quot;:false}">
							<div class="elementor-background-overlay"></div>
							<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-no">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-cad9ea8" data-id="cad9ea8" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div data-dce-advanced-background-image-url="https://prcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/gold-angle-1.svg" class="elementor-element elementor-element-39ad50a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="39ad50a" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Success Stories</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div data-dce-title-color="#FDBB2D" class="elementor-element elementor-element-6c4a546 ha-equal-height-yes ha-testimonial-carousel--bottom ha-testimonial-carousel--bubble ha-testimonial-carousel--left elementor-widget elementor-widget-ha-testimonial-carousel happy-addon ha-testimonial-carousel happy-addon-pro" data-id="6c4a546" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;slides_to_show&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;slides_to_show_mobile&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;animation_speed&quot;:800,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;navigation&quot;:&quot;arrow&quot;,&quot;slides_to_show_tablet&quot;:3}" data-widget_type="ha-testimonial-carousel.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					
        <div data-ha_rcc_uid="" class="ha-testimonial-carousel__wrap">

                        <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel-slick-slide slick-slide">
                <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__item">
                    <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__content">
                        After graduating from Pearl River Community College in 2026, Diego Sosa Vazquez earned one of the nation's most prestigious transfer scholarships, the Jack Kent Cooke Scholarship, and was accepted to Yale University, where he will pursue a bachelor's degree in philosophy. While at PRCC, Sosa served in leadership roles with Student Government Association, Phi Theta Kappa, and the History and Humanities Club, while also conducting award-winning independent research on Mexican cultural identity through the Dr. William Lewis Honors Institute. Following Yale, he plans to attend law school and pursue a career in human rights law, building on the foundation of academic excellence and leadership he developed at Pearl River.                    </div>
                    <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer">
                                                    <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer-thumb">
                                <img decoding="async" src="https://prcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/PRCC_Pearl_River_Community_College_Jorge-Alcantara.jpg" alt="Diego Sosa Vazquez ">
                            </div>
                        
                        <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer-meta">
                            <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer-name">
                                Diego Sosa Vazquez                             </div>
                            <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer-title">
                                                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

                        <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel-slick-slide slick-slide">
                <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__item">
                    <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__content">
                        Lilli Carter recently graduated with an Associate of Arts degree from Pearl River Community College, where she graduated with honors and was actively involved as a member of the Phi Theta Kappa Honor Society and a River Navigator. During her time at PRCC, she demonstrated a strong commitment to both academic excellence and student leadership. After graduation, Lilli completed the 2026 Disney College Program, spending six months living and working at Walt Disney World Resort in Orlando. This experience helped her develop valuable skills in communication, teamwork, and guest relations. Lilli plans to continue her education at the University of South Alabama, where she will pursue a master’s degree in Marketing and build a successful career in the field.                    </div>
                    <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer">
                                                    <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer-thumb">
                                <img decoding="async" src="https://prcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/PRCC_Pearl_River_Community_College_Lilli_Carter.jpg" alt="Lilli Carter">
                            </div>
                        
                        <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer-meta">
                            <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer-name">
                                Lilli Carter                            </div>
                            <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer-title">
                                                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

                        <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel-slick-slide slick-slide">
                <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__item">
                    <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__content">
                        Mary-Catherine Galloway graduated with an A.A.S in Nursing. During her time at the River, she participated in a variety of organizations and leadership positions such as the Spirit of the River Marching Band, the PRCC Singers, a Phi Theta Kappa Member, a Resident Assistant for Forrest Hall, and Class President for the Spring 2024 Pearl River Community College ADN Program. She has landed her dream job as a postpartum nurse at Forrest General Hospital, and she will further her education in pursuing her BSN and MSN (with a focus on Family Nurse Practitioner) at The University of Southern Mississippi.                    </div>
                    <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer">
                                                    <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer-thumb">
                                <img decoding="async" src="https://prcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Mary-C-Galloway.jpg" alt="Mary-Catherine Galloway">
                            </div>
                        
                        <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer-meta">
                            <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer-name">
                                Mary-Catherine Galloway                            </div>
                            <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer-title">
                                                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

                        <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel-slick-slide slick-slide">
                <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__item">
                    <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__content">
                        Natalie Herrington was a two-year starter for the Wildcat softball team. She was named Second Team All-NJCAA, All-Region 23, First Team All-MACCC, MACCC Pitcher of the Year, NFCA All-South Region and First Team NFCA All-American following the 2024 season. Natalie was equally impressive in the classroom, graduating with special honors as a Dr. William Lewis Honors Institute member and Phi Theta Kappa member. Natalie will continue her academic and athletic careers at the University of Southern Mississippi.                    </div>
                    <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer">
                                                    <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer-thumb">
                                <img decoding="async" src="https://prcc.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/PRCC_Success_Stories_Herrington.jpg" alt="Natalie Herrington">
                            </div>
                        
                        <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer-meta">
                            <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer-name">
                                Natalie Herrington                            </div>
                            <div class="ha-testimonial-carousel__reviewer-title">
                                                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

                    </div>
	    				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
